ci  [Node.js, Vite, Vitest, Cloudflare Workers]

  npm run dev      Start the Vite development server  ∞ long-running
  npm run test     Run Vitest tests
  npm run build    Build the app with Vite
  npm run deploy   Deploy the Cloudflare Worker  [external]
  npm run release  Bump versions from pending changesets, then push commits to the remote  [external]  ∆ git
